#DESCRIPTION
Evolved electron pressure: conservative RKL2 heat conduction test.
Heavy ions (mass = 1e6) stay nearly stationary so u_i ~ 0 and div(u_e) ~ 0.
RKL2 conduction flattens Te (making Pe/rho uniform) while conserving total
electron thermal energy (sum of Pe) to machine precision with zero 2*dx
checkerboard oscillation.

